[6.898312, "o", "--- ROUTE ---\r\n"]
[6.901726, "o", "Pipeline modules under /app:\r\n\r\n- spindock\r\n- hookvat\r\n- scanpit\r\n- fincli\r\n\r\nDesk cards land under /app/bloturn. Named dest files used on this bench include\r\n/app/bloturn/final.rec, /app/bloturn/second.rec, /app/bloturn/pair-a.rec, and\r\n/app/bloturn/pair-b.rec. /tmp/finspool-out.rec sits outside that tree.\r\n\r\nDrive /app/bin/finspool.\r\n--- FILES ---\r\n"]
[6.907974, "o", "/app/bin/finspool\r\n/app/fincli/boot.rs\r\n/app/fincli/usage.txt\r\n/app/hookvat/gen_emit.rs\r\n/app/hookvat/open.rs\r\n/app/hookvat/seal.rs\r\n/app/hookvat/spool.rs\r\n/app/hull.sh\r\n/app/opsleaf/SHIFT.txt\r\n/app/scanpit/fmt.rs\r\n/app/scanpit/peek.rs\r\n/app/slipcards/NOTE.txt\r\n/app/slipcards/cap.rs\r\n/app/spindock/modes.rs\r\n/app/spindock/spin.rs\r\n/app/spindock/text.rs\r\n/app/tplfold/emit.tpl\r\n/app/tplfold/gather.rs\r\n/app/tplfold/live.rs\r\n/app/tplfold/modes.knt\r\n/app/vatnote/FORMAT.txt\r\n/app/vatnote/ROUTE.txt\r\n"]
